Subject: [PATCH 06873/11362] [outer-loop] ARC s5i5 round-5: L7->L8, FULL GAME
 CLEAR

Round-5 claude-fable-5 attempt on s5i5 solved L8, the final level of the
game. Executes round-4's decoded controls (paired 9/7 reshapes the upper
carriage, 8/A reshapes the lower carriage, E lowers the diamond carrier
and extends the chamber's E arm, B rotates the four-color chamber cross)
and finds the missing piece: an arm aimed through the bottom opening may
continue extending OFF-SCREEN after its visible pixels reach row 62,
letting E carry the diamond all the way to the lower socket.

Won live at action 382; fresh reproduce() confirmed reached_level=8,
completing the game's 8 win levels. Independently re-verified by the
outer loop: 5x fresh env.reset() + replay via a new resolver priority
branch, all 5 confirmed level=8, state=GameState.WIN.

reproducible_total_levels 153 -> 154 (15th full game clear).
arc_count_integrity_lint.py exit 0.

